},{"id":29,"description":"Steam Trading Cards"},{"id":30,"description":"Steam Workshop"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":15,"description":"Stats"},{"id":17,"description":"Includes level editor"},{"id":41,"description":"Remote Play on Phone"},{"id":42,"description":"Remote Play on Tablet"},{"id":43,"description":"Remote Play on TV"},{"id":44,"description":"Remote Play Together"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"323850","steamName":"Move or Die","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/323850/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T08:56:33.871607+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Move or Die is an absurdly fast-paced 4-player local and online party game where the mechanics change every 20 seconds! It's THE friendship-ruining game.","detailedDescription":"Free DLC Forever & Mods\n\nOur idea of an awesome game is a constantly updated one. So we plan to release regular content updates, consisting of new game modes, characters, levels and even new mechanics, completely FREE of charge!\n\nOn top of that, the game is mod friendly and has a level editor as well as Steam Workshop support, so you can browse through awesome content made by fellow players like you! After all, the game's initials are MOD. Check out our modding wiki on our official website.\n\nAbout the Game\nMove or Die is the frenzied and unpredictable 4-player party game where the rules change every 20 seconds. With only ONE constant: If you don’t move, you DIE.\n\nWhether on the couch with friends or playing online with people from around the world, join the mayhem at any given time and put a bit of BOOM in your everyday life 💣\n\nPlay as one of several outrageous characters on the couch with friends, online against people from around the world, or battle devious bots offline.\n\nChoose from a 35+ and always increasing roster of original game modes like Jump Shot, Chainsaw Backstab, Rocket Run and more! \n\nNeed more chaos? Activate special game-changing modifiers that keep things fresh by bending the rules even further.\n\nAcquire unique skins for your character and unlock new game modes as you smash your online opponents.\n\n Daily Contributions - A community-wide challenge! Check in every day to pitch in towards a global community goal that unlocks  special and exclusive items for all contributors!\n\n FREE Content Updates: New content, including game modes, characters and new features are added on a regular basis to keep Move or Die’s friendship-ruining-meter high. Always for free, forever and ever.\n\n Blessed by the MODs: Build and share your own characters, game modes, mechanics, levels, soundtracks and more. Includes Steam Workshop support, as well as a super user-friendly level editor.","aboutGame":"Move or Die is the frenzied and unpredictable 4-player party game where the rules change every 20 seconds. With only ONE constant: If you don’t move, you DIE.\n\nWhether on the couch with friends or playing online with people from around the world, join the mayhem at any given time and put a bit of BOOM in your everyday life 💣\n\nPlay as one of several outrageous characters on the couch with friends, online against people from around the world, or battle devious bots offline.\n\nChoose from a 35+ and always increasing roster of original game modes like Jump Shot, Chainsaw Backstab, Rocket Run and more! \n\nNeed more chaos? Activate special game-changing modifiers that keep things fresh by bending the rules even further.\n\nAcquire unique skins for your character and unlock new game modes as you smash your online opponents.\n\n Daily Contributions - A community-wide challenge! Check in every day to pitch in towards a global community goal that unlocks  special and exclusive items for all contributors!\n\n FREE Content Updates: New content, including game modes, characters and new features are added on a regular basis to keep Move or Die’s friendship-ruining-meter high. Always for free, forever and ever.\n\n Blessed by the MODs: Build and share your own characters, game modes, mechanics, levels, soundtracks and more. Includes Steam Workshop support, as well as a super user-friendly level editor."},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/323850/header.jpg?t=1728465590"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/323850/f553be88d481782edadd94f8f46d9d330eb655e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1728465590"},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/323850/extras/4ab6224afdfda392948330d81696c77b.avif?t=1728465590","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/323850/extras/94a2a9d3382883070f6cf4863e2765e1.webp?t=1728465590","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/323850/extras/427ab4830b8d45640212f2e5b459c010.webp?t=1728465590","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/323850/extras/27591c75f5d5544c11f78032fd516f66.webp?t=1728465590","alt":""}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/323850/ss_45559ced90267540ae7c3fa6796b1af155428fc9.600x338.jpg?t=1728465590","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/323850/ss_45559ced90267540ae7c3fa6796b1af155428fc9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1728465590"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/323850/ss_143048d360508522352bfdd8e2dd527c80560391.600x338.jpg?t=1728465590","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/323850/ss_143048d360508522352bfdd8e2dd527c80560391.1